B.bqp=s(["PSAX view, 1 O'clock",u.F,"Display RV systole waveform","Calculate RVET: from start to end of the trace waveform","Calculate time to peak velocity: from start of trace to peak","PAAT = time from start of RV ejection to peak pulmonary velocity","IMPORTANT: measure from start to EARLIEST peak, NOT mid-peak","Waveform is more rounded and not wedge-shaped in high PAP"],t.s)
